WEBVTT

00:09:59.555 --> 00:10:03.366
and focusing on earth-friendly,
zero-waste habits

00:10:03.390 --> 00:10:05.519
is not an option anymore.

00:10:06.056 --> 00:10:10.296
And who knows the key ingredients
better than our ancestors,

00:10:10.320 --> 00:10:13.239
the ones who survived without the media

00:10:13.263 --> 00:10:14.745
or technology

00:10:14.769 --> 00:10:16.684
but with wisdom alone?

00:10:17.690 --> 00:10:20.009
As a citizen of Mongolia,

00:10:20.033 --> 00:10:21.604
I grew up hearing

00:10:21.628 --> 00:10:25.051
that developing countries are inferior,

00:10:25.075 --> 00:10:27.111
and I really took it to heart.

00:10:27.811 --> 00:10:32.489
But today, I want to say loud and clear